<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;p&gt;[stevieb] [id://1211419|is right], I wasn't being (entirely) serious. Modules in the [cpan://Acme::] namespace are generally meant to be tongue-in-cheek, silly, and/or not for production use. I also gave that example to show off some of the power of Perl, in this case its ability to rewrite source code on the fly.&lt;/p&gt;
